		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Decaying corpses glued, stitched, and pinned together in a mishmash of rotten flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +1 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Carrion Stench</strong>. Living creatures CON 12+ the first time within near or DISADV on attacks and spellcasting for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. The animate dead spell destroys golem.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
